MVIE REBOOTS GO DOWN IN PHRASE.

00:00:17.641 --> 00:00:18.941
HERE'S RAYMOND ARROYO.

00:00:18.942 --> 00:00:20.509
YOU HAVE BREAKING BIDEN NEWS?

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:24.180
&gt;&gt; HIS SON, HUNTER, WAS SUED IN

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:25.581
AUGUST BY A WOMAN THAT CLAIMS

00:00:25.582 --> 00:00:27.650
SHE HAD A RELATIONSHIP AND A

00:00:27.651 --> 00:00:29.151
