00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:45.034
FIELD CORRESPONDENT.

00:00:45.035 --> 00:00:46.769
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE THE FATHER!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.105
&gt;&gt; EVERY CHILD IS A BLESSING,

00:00:49.106 --> 00:00:49.672
