00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.387
A GRANDFATHER AGAIN?

00:01:05.388 --> 00:01:05.888
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:01:05.889 --> 00:01:07.289
THAT'S A PRIVATE MATTER.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.658
NO COMMENT.

00:01:09.659 --> 00:01:12.461
ONLY YOU WOULD ASK THAT.

00:01:12.462 --> 00:01:13.929
YOU'RE A GOOD MAN.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:14.330
CLASSY.

00:01:14.331 --> 00:01:15.631
&gt;&gt; CLASSY?

00:01:15.632 --> 00:01:17.500
IF I WERE JOE BIDEN I WOULDN'T

00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:20.336
BE THROWING CLASSY AROUND WHEN

00:01:20.337 --> 00:01:21.470
HUNTER -- I LOVE THAT.

00:01:21.471 --> 00:01:24.140
HE DENIED THE RELATIONSHIP AND

00:01:24.141 --> 00:01:25.574
EVER MEETING HER.

00:01:25.575 --> 00:01:26.842
SO NOW --

00:01:26.843 --> 00:01:29.145
&gt;&gt; NOT ONLY DID HE MEET HER, HE

00:01:29.146 --> 00:01:30.212
HAD A CHILD WITH HER.

00:01:30.213 --> 00:01:31.680
&gt;&gt; Laura: IF YOU CAN'T TRUST HIM

00:01:31.681 --> 00:01:33.883
ON HIS OWN FLESH AND BLOOD, HOW

00:01:33.884 --> 00:01:35.384
DO YOU TRUST HIM ON I DIDN'T

00:01:35.385 --> 00:01:37.887
SPEAK TO MY DAD AT ALL ABOUT

00:01:37.888 --> 00:01:38.521
BURISMA?

00:01:38.522 --> 00:01:40.856
&gt;&gt; THE BIDENS HAVE BEEN TRASHING

00:01:40.857 --> 00:01:43.993
TRUMP NOR BEING A REALITY STORE.

00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:46.896
LOOKS LIKE THEY'RE DOING IT.

00:01:46.897 --> 00:01:47.897
DURING THE IMPEACHMENT HEARINGS,

00:01:47.898 --> 00:01:49.698
DAVID HOLMES THAT WORKED AT THE

00:01:49.699 --> 00:01:51.767
U.S. UKRAINIAN EMBASSY TESTIFIED

00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:54.003
THAT HE OVERHEARD A CONVERSATION

00:01:54.004 --> 00:01:55.805
BETWEEN THE PRESIDENT AND

00:01:55.806 --> 00:01:56.972
AMBASSADOR SONDLAND.

00:01:56.973 --> 00:01:59.508
HE CLAIMS HE COULD HEAR THE

00:01:59.509 --> 00:02:01.076
PRESIDENT'S VOICE DESPITE THE

00:02:01.077 --> 00:02:04.213
FACT THAT THE CALL WAS NOT ON

00:02:04.214 --> 00:02:04.980
SPEAKER PHONE.

00:02:04.981 --> 00:02:06.982
THE PRESIDENT SAID MY HEARING IS

00:02:06.983 --> 00:02:08.117
ALWAYS GREAT.

00:02:08.118 --> 00:02:09.585
NEVER HAVE I SEEN A PERSON

00:02:09.586 --> 00:02:11.120
MAKING A CALL THAT WAS NOT ON

00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:12.321
SPEAKER PHONE AND BE ABLE TO

00:02:12.322 --> 00:02:13.722
HEAR OR UNDERSTAND A

00:02:13.723 --> 00:02:14.156
CONVERSATION.

00:02:14.157 --> 00:02:16.892
I TRIED IT TO NO AVAIL.

00:02:16.893 --> 00:02:18.327
TRY IT LIVE.

00:02:18.328 --> 00:02:21.163
SO CNN'S CHRIS CUOMO TRIED IT

00:02:21.164 --> 00:02:22.498
LIVE WITH HIS MOMMA.

00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:24.066
&gt;&gt; VERY INTERESTING THEORY FROM

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:24.533
OUR PRESIDENT.

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:27.803
HE'S NEVER BEEN ABLE TO HEAR A

00:02:27.804 --> 00:02:30.539
PHONE CALL WHEN IT WASN'T ON

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.974
SPEAKER PHONE FROM ANYBODY.

00:02:31.975 --> 00:02:34.109
SO LET'S JUST PLAY WITH THAT FOR

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.211
A SECOND.

00:02:35.212 --> 00:02:37.179
MOM, CAN YOU HEAR ME?

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:39.448
I'M WITH DANA.

00:02:39.449 --> 00:02:43.018
DID SHE JUST SAID HELLO?

00:02:43.019 --> 00:02:44.553
MOM?

00:02:44.554 --> 00:02:45.955
I CAN'T HEAR YOUR MOTHER.

00:02:45.956 --> 00:02:48.224
&gt;&gt; THIS IS ACROSS THE TABLE.

00:02:48.225 --> 00:02:49.792
&gt;&gt; HE COULDN'T GET CONFIRMATION.

00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:51.026
IF YOU'RE GOING TO PULL A STUNT

00:02:51.027 --> 00:02:53.295
LIKE THIS, TEST IT OUT FIRST AND

00:02:53.296 --> 00:02:54.330
MAKE SURE EVERYBODY CAN HEAR.

00:02:54.331 --> 00:02:56.498
BY THE WAY, HE HAD HIS PHONE ON

00:02:56.499 --> 00:02:56.832
SPEAKER.

00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:58.434
THAT IS NOT WHAT THE PRESIDENT

00:02:58.435 --> 00:02:58.734
SAID.

00:02:58.735 --> 00:03:01.904
SO IT'S -- THIS WAS A DISASTER

00:03:01.905 --> 00:03:02.805
FOR CHRIS CUOMO.

00:03:02.806 --> 00:03:04.173
&gt;&gt; Laura: I KEEP THINKING THE

00:03:04.174 --> 00:03:05.841
GLOVE WITH O.J. AND DIDN'T FIT.

00:03:05.842 --> 00:03:07.243
KIND OF LIKE THAT.

